<title>THAILAND: Property Perfect 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Property Perfect 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		6.79	vs		9.08</p>
<p>    Net		     433.63	vs	    365.22</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Property Perfect Plc, a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
